<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>우리 동네 단체도시락 1등, 도시락담다 | 프리미엄 수제 단체도시락</title>
  <meta name="description" content="회의·행사·학원·세미나 맞춤 제작 (10개~500개 OK). 공장에서 찍어내는 냉동 도시락이 아닌 당일 수제 도시락! 10분 내 맞춤 견적 안내." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.css" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-page: #f5f3ef;
      --bg-white: #ffffff;
      --bg-warm: #faf8f5;
      --brand-dark: #161f1d;
      --brand-dark-2: #222e2b;
      --accent: #e05a1b;
      --accent-hover: #c94c12;
      --accent-soft: #fff2eb;
      --kakao: #fee500;
      --text-main: #1b1f1e;
      --text-sub: #5a6260;
      --text-muted: #88918e;
      --border: #e6e2da;
      --radius-lg: 16px;
      --radius-md: 12px;
      --shadow-sm: 0 2px 10px rgba(22, 31, 29, 0.04);
      --shadow-md: 0 10px 30px rgba(22, 31, 29, 0.08);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding-bottom: 78px;
      font-family: "Pretendard", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg-page);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.5;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .wrap { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 18px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;
      text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 10px;
      cursor: pointer; border: none; transition: all 0.18s ease;
      font-family: inherit;
    }
    .btn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }

    /* Top Sticky Header */
    .top-header {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 900;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .header-inner {
      max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 12px 18px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand-dark);
      text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: -0.4px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    }
    .logo-badge {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; background: var(--accent-soft);
      color: var(--accent); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 99px;
    }
    .nav-links { display: none; gap: 20px; }
    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-sub);
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .header-cta { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .btn-header-kakao { background: var(--kakao); color: #191919; padding: 8px 13px; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 8px; }
    .btn-header-quote { background: var(--brand-dark); color: #fff; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 8px; }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #161f1d 0%, #24322e 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 46px 0 48px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; align-items: center;
    }
    .hero-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      background: rgba(224, 90, 27, 0.18);
      border: 1px solid rgba(224, 90, 27, 0.5);
      color: #ffb894;
      padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 99px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 31px; font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -0.7px;
    }
    .hero h1 span { color: #ff9c6b; }
    .hero-sub {
      margin: 0 0 22px; font-size: 15px; color: #d1dad6; line-height: 1.65;
    }
    .hero-btns { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; padding: 14px 24px; font-size: 15px; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); }
    .btn-kakao { background: var(--kakao); color: #191919; padding: 14px 22px; font-size: 15px; }
    .btn-ghost {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.24); padding: 14px 20px; font-size: 15px;
    }
    .hero-visual {
      position: relative; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    }
    .hero-visual img { width: 100%; display: block; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; }
    .hero-visual-tag {
      position: absolute; bottom: 12px; left: 12px; right: 12px;
      background: rgba(22, 31, 29, 0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      color: #fff; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    }
    .hero-visual-tag span { color: #ff9c6b; font-weight: 800; }

    /* Trust Stats Bar */
    .stats-wrap { margin-top: -24px; position: relative; z-index: 10; }
    .stats-grid {
      background: var(--bg-white); border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .stat-item {
      padding: 18px 14px; text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .stat-item:nth-child(2n) { border-right: none; }
    .stat-num { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand-dark); margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .stat-num em { font-style: normal; color: var(--accent); }
    .stat-label { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500; }

    /* Common Section */
    .section { padding: 52px 0; }
    .section-card-bg { background: var(--bg-white); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .section-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .section-eyebrow {
      display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 0.6px; margin-bottom: 8px;
      background: var(--accent-soft); padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 99px;
    }
    .section-title {
      margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--brand-dark); letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.35;
    }
    .section-desc {
      margin: 0 auto; max-width: 600px; font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--text-sub); line-height: 1.65;
    }

    /* Use-Case Grid (B2B 맞춤 상황) */
    .usecase-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .usecase-card {
      background: var(--bg-white); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 18px 16px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .usecase-icon { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 8px; display: block; }
    .usecase-card h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand-dark); }
    .usecase-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-sub); line-height: 1.5; }

    /* Brand Copy + 2 Photos */
    .story-box {
      background: var(--bg-white); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 26px 20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .photo-grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .photo-card { position: relative; border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden; }
    .photo-card img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    .photo-caption {
      position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,0.72));
      color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 20px 10px 10px;
    }
    .check-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; margin-top: 18px; }
    .check-item {
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;
      background: var(--bg-warm); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 14px 16px;
    }
    .check-badge {
      flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent); color: #fff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .check-item strong { display: block; font-size: 15px; color: var(--brand-dark); margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .check-item span { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-sub); line-height: 1.5; }

    .cta-strip {
      margin-top: 22px; background: var(--accent-soft);
      border: 1px solid #ffd5be; border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 20px; text-align: center;
    }
    .cta-strip p { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand-dark); }
    .cta-strip-btns { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; }
    .btn-sm-white { background: #fff; color: var(--brand-dark); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; }

    /* Quality Banner */
    .quality-banner {
      background: var(--brand-dark); color: #fff;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 26px 22px;
      margin-bottom: 24px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      border-left: 5px solid var(--accent);
    }
    .quality-banner h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.4; }
    .quality-banner p { margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; color: #cfd8d5; line-height: 1.6; }

    /* Menu Tabs & Cards */
    .menu-tabs {
      display: flex; gap: 8px; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 20px;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }
    .menu-tab {
      flex-shrink: 0; background: var(--bg-warm); color: var(--text-sub);
      border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 9px 16px;
      border-radius: 99px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s; font-family: inherit;
    }
    .menu-tab.active {
      background: var(--brand-dark); color: #fff; border-color: var(--brand-dark);
    }

    .menu-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
    .menu-card {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: stretch; gap: 14px;
      background: var(--bg-white); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 14px;
      transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
    }
    .menu-card:hover { border-color: #d2ccc2; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
    .menu-card.hidden { display: none; }
    .menu-info { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
    .menu-cat-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .menu-name { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand-dark); line-height: 1.35; }
    .tag {
      display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
      background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent);
      padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; margin-left: 4px; vertical-align: middle;
    }
    .menu-desc { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 6px 0 10px; line-height: 1.45; }
    .menu-bottom { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
    .menu-price { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand-dark); }
    .btn-pick {
      background: var(--bg-warm); color: var(--brand-dark);
      border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 6px 11px;
      border-radius: 7px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;
    }
    .btn-pick:hover { background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); border-color: #ffc5a8; }
    .btn-pick.picked { background: var(--brand-dark); color: #fff; border-color: var(--brand-dark); }
    .menu-thumb {
      width: 98px; height: 98px; object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 10px; background: #eee; flex-shrink: 0; align-self: center;
    }

    /* Process Section */
    .process-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; align-items: center; }
    .process-img {
      width: 100%; max-height: 520px; object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg); display: block; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .process-steps { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    .step-card {
      background: var(--bg-white); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 18px;
      display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .step-num {
      flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800;
      background: var(--brand-dark); color: #fff;
      padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .step-card h4 { margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand-dark); }
    .step-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-sub); line-height: 1.55; }

    /* Inquiry Form (B2B Modern Style) */
    .inquiry-box {
      background: var(--bg-white); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 28px 20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }
    .quick-contact-bar {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px;
      background: var(--bg-warm); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .quick-contact-text strong { display: block; font-size: 15px; color: var(--brand-dark); margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .quick-contact-text span { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-sub); }
    .quick-contact-btns { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .quick-contact-btns .btn { flex: 1; padding: 11px 12px; font-size: 13.5px; }

    .form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; }
    .form-group label { display: block; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-dark); margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .form-group label .req { color: var(--accent); }
    .form-group input, .form-group select, .form-group textarea {
      width: 100%; padding: 12px 13px; border: 1px solid #d5d1c8;
      border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-family: inherit;
      background: #fff; color: var(--text-main); transition: border-color 0.15s;
    }
    .form-group input:focus, .form-group select:focus, .form-group textarea:focus {
      outline: none; border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(224, 90, 27, 0.12);
    }
    .doc-checks { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 4px; }
    .doc-check-label {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      background: var(--bg-warm); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .doc-check-label input { width: auto; margin: 0; accent-color: var(--accent); }
    .privacy-row {
      margin-top: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-sub);
    }
    .privacy-row input { width: 16px; height: 16px; accent-color: var(--accent); }
    .submit-btn {
      width: 100%; margin-top: 16px; background: var(--accent); color: #fff;
      border: none; padding: 16px; border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(224, 90, 27, 0.25);
    }
    .submit-btn:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
      text-align: center; padding: 28px 18px 36px;
      font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* Sticky Bottom Bar */
    .sticky-bar {
      position: fixed; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 999;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      box-shadow: 0 -4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      padding: 10px 12px;
    }
    .sticky-inner { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .sticky-inner .btn { flex: 1; padding: 12px 8px; font-size: 13.5px; border-radius: 9px; }
    .sticky-call { background: var(--brand-dark); color: #fff; }
    .sticky-kakao { background: var(--kakao); color: #191919; }
    .sticky-quote { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }

    /* Toast */
    .toast {
      position: fixed; bottom: 84px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(16px);
      background: var(--brand-dark); color: #fff; padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 99px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
      opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: all 0.22s ease; z-index: 1000;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }

    /* Desktop / Tablet Responsive */
    @media (min-width: 720px) {
      .nav-links { display: flex; }
      .hero { padding: 60px 0 64px; }
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; gap: 36px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 38px; }
      .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
      .stat-item { border-bottom: none; }
      .stat-item:nth-child(2n) { border-right: 1px solid var(--border); }
      .stat-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
      .usecase-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
      .check-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
      .menu-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .process-grid { grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr; gap: 28px; }
      .quick-contact-bar { grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; align-items: center; }
      .form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .form-group.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
      .inquiry-box { padding: 36px 32px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- 상단 고정 헤더 -->
  <header class="top-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a href="#" class="logo">도시락담다 <span class="logo-badge">단체주문 전문</span></a>
      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#features">서비스 강점</a>
        <a href="#menu">메뉴 라인업</a>
        <a href="#process">제작·배송</a>
        <a href="#inquiry">견적 신청</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="header-cta">
        <a href="https://pf.kakao.com/_zcfexj" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-header-kakao">카톡 상담</a>
        <a href="#inquiry" class="btn btn-header-quote">견적 문의</a>
      </div>
    </div>
